<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian currency reserves up 2.4 pct in April.</title>
<headline>Austrian currency reserves up 2.4 pct in April.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian foreign currency reserves rose 2.4 percent to 204.534 billion schillings in April, the National Bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +43-1 531 12 254</p>
</text>
